1
00:00:00,149 --> 00:00:03,399
(Sheldon:)I do not have to urinate.

2
00:00:06,155 --> 00:00:09,995
(Sheldon:)I am the master of my own bladder.

3
00:00:12,078 --> 00:00:14,208
(Sheldon:)Drat.

4
00:00:16,624 --> 00:00:19,544
(Penny:)I can't believe it. If I hadn't
been working the dinner shift...

5
00:00:19,710 --> 00:00:21,670
...I would've run right into
the robbers.

6
00:00:21,879 --> 00:00:24,089
(Leonard:)Hey, there's no reason for you
to be scared.

7
00:00:24,256 --> 00:00:28,716
(Penny:)I'm not scared. I would've gone
all Nebraska on their asses.

8
00:00:29,470 --> 00:00:30,510
[KNOCKING]

9
00:00:30,679 --> 00:00:31,809
SHELDON: Leonard and Penny.
Leonard and Penny.

10
00:00:31,972 --> 00:00:35,222
(Sheldon:)-Leonard and Penny.
-Hand me the bat.

11
00:00:38,437 --> 00:00:40,527
(Sheldon:)We just had a major crime
in the building...

12
00:00:40,689 --> 00:00:44,189
(Sheldon:)...and you open the door
without asking who it is?

